{"title": "Aspect of the Elk (Condition)", "pageid": 17320, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Elk Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Aspect of the Elk</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> increased by +1.5 m (5 ft), as long as the affected entity stays near the barbarian. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ASPECT_OF_THE_ELK</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CASPECT_OF_THE_ELK%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CASPECT_OF_THE_ELK%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Aspect_of_the_Elk\">Sources of Aspect of the Elk</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura (Condition)\">Aspect of the Elk Aura</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>ASPECT_OF_THE_ELK</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aspect_of_the_Elk\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Elk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Elk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Aspect of the Elk</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> increased by +1.5 m (5 ft), as long as the affected entity stays near the barbarian.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aspect_of_the_Elk_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Elk_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Elk Aura (Condition)\">Aspect of the Elk Aura</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity and nearby allies have a +1.5 m (5 ft) bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1873/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26442/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6462/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1171490/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.132      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   59.132      1 -total\n 53.61%   31.702      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 33.80%   19.989      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 20.57%   12.166      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 19.57%   11.573      1 Template:MdCond\n 18.96%   11.211      5 Template:Icon_link\n 17.74%   10.491      5 Template:Icon_text\n 15.58%    9.215     19 Template:Trim\n 13.93%    8.236      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17320-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202016 and revision id 374758. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}